DECISIONS 213, TYPES.md §12.3: a record with a function-typed field is broken, so its type is not refused again by the go emit (no E8012).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A time of day.
record TimeOfDay {
  /// Its hour.
  hour: Int
  /// A function.
  zzFn: fn(Int) -> Int
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E3306]  a/a.canon:8:9
  a function type is not allowed here

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
